abstract: >-
  Code, notebooks, and results for a BSc Physics final project at the
  Universitat de Barcelona. The project studies inverse Ising inference
  using maximum pseudolikelihood, simulated annealing, and gradient descent.
keywords:
  - inverse Ising problem
  - statistical physics
  - pseudolikelihood
  - simulated annealing
  - gradient descent
